#### CaucasianOpportunities

#### \[AU\]

CaucasianOpportunities is a Naarm-based DJ whose genre-fluid sets blur the lines between bass music, jungle, techno, footwork and other underground subgenres. Her dynamic approach to rhythm and flow, anchored in heavy basslines has positioned her as one of Melbourne’s most compelling selectors.

