# UTA Expo

[](https://www.facebook.com/ultratrailaustralia)[](https://instagram.com/ultratrailaustralia)[](https://www.youtube.com/user/AROCSport)

Event ExpoExhibitor Bookings

## THURSDAY 13 MAY: 9AM – 7:30PM



## FRIDAY 14 MAY: 10AM – 7PM

The Ultra-Trail Australia by UTMB Event Expo is an energetic and dynamic festival style expo celebrating the world of ultra-trail running and adventure.

Showcasing thousands of products & services from the running and outdoor industry, plus food stalls and coffee stands … the super-popular expo is a highlight of the event weekend and is the place to catch-up with old friends and make new ones.

Located directly opposite race check-in at KCC, the expo is frequented by thousands of excited trail runners, supporters and spectators and support crew that descend upon Katoomba each May for Australia's largest trail race.

